#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:31
msgid "Floc Filtration in Conventional Clarifiers"
msgstr "Filtración por floc en clarificadores convencionales"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:33
msgid ""
"Flocs that are created by the flocculator settle through the water column in"
" conventional sedimentation tanks. As the flocs settle a fraction of the "
"water passes through the floc where the suspension experiences floc "
"filtration. This particle removal mechanism increases in importance as the "
"raw water turbidity increases and the resulting concentration of flocs "
"increases. To describe the physics of this system we define three volumes."
msgstr ""
"Los flócs creados por el floculador se asientan a través de la columna de "
"agua en tanques de sedimentación convencionales. A medida que los flócs se "
"asientan, una fracción del agua pasa por el flóc, donde la suspensión "
"experimenta filtración por flócs. Este mecanismo de eliminación de "
"partículas cobra importancia a medida que aumenta la turbidez agua cruda y "
"la concentración resultante de flócs. Para describir la física de este "
"sistema definimos tres volúmenes."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:35
msgid ""
"The volume cleared, :math:`\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}` by a floc is equal to "
"the cleared area as the floc moves relative to the suspension multiplied by "
"the total distance traveled relative to the suspension. In a horizontal flow"
" sedimentation tank the average distance traveled could be 1/2 the depth of "
"water in the sedimentation basin. It is possible that the volume cleared is "
"proportional to the fraction coverage of the particles by coagulant "
"nanoparticles. The volume cleared may also be a function of the floc size."
msgstr ""
"El volumen liberado, :math:`\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}` por un flóc, es igual "
"al área despejada a medida que el flóculum se mueve respecto a la "
"suspensión, multiplicado por la distancia total recorrida respecto a la "
"suspensión. En un tanque de sedimentación de flujo horizontal, la distancia "
"media recorrida podría ser 1/2 la profundidad del agua en la cuenca de "
"sedimentación. Es posible que el volumen eliminado sea proporcional a la "
"cobertura fraccionaria de las partículas por nanopartículas coagulantes. El "
"volumen despejado también puede ser función del tamaño del flóculo."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:37
msgid ""
"The volume surrounding a floc, :math:`\\forall_{\\rm{Surround}}`, is the "
"volume of the suspension divided by the number of flocs in that suspension."
msgstr ""
"El volumen que rodea un flóculo, :math:`\\forall_{\\rm{Surround}}`, es el "
"volumen de la suspensión dividido por el número de flóclos en esa "
"suspensión."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:39
msgid ""
"The volume of the reactor or suspension that is an arbitrary large volume "
"that will eventually drop out of the analysis, "
":math:`\\forall_{\\rm{Suspension}}`."
msgstr ""
"El volumen del reactor o suspensión que es un volumen arbitrario y grande "
"que eventualmente saldrá del análisis, :math:`\\forall_{\\rm{Suspension}}`."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:41
msgid ""
"We will treat the clearing events when a floc falls through the suspension "
"as sequential events with complete mixing of the primary particles between "
"clearing events. This assumption is based on the mixing caused by turbulence"
" of the flow in the sedimentation tank and the initial random distribution "
"of flocs. The initial nonsettleable particle concentration, :math:`C_{P_0}`,"
" will be reduced by each clearing event. The nonsettleable particle "
"concentration after the first clearing event, :math:`C_{P_{one floc}}`, is "
"given by"
msgstr ""
"Trataremos los eventos de despeje cuando un flóc cae a través de la "
"suspensión como eventos secuenciales con mezcla completa de las partículas "
"primarias entre eventos de limpieza. Esta suposición se basa en la mezcla "
"causada por la turbulencia del flujo en el tanque de sedimentación y la "
"distribución aleatoria inicial de flócs. La concentración inicial de "
"partículas no asentables, :math:`C_{P_0}`, se reducirá con cada evento de "
"limpieza. La concentración de partículas no asentables tras el primer evento"
" de limpieza, :math:`C_{P_{one floc}}`, se da por"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:43
msgid ""
"C_{P_{one floc}} = C_{P_0} \\left( 1 - "
"\\frac{{\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Suspension}}} \\right)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:48
msgid ""
"The total number of clearing events is given by the total number of flocs in"
" the suspension."
msgstr ""
"El número total de eventos de limpieza se determina por el número total de "
"flócs en la suspensión."

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:50
msgid ""
"N_{Clearing} = "
"\\frac{{\\forall_{\\rm{Suspension}}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Surround}}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:55
msgid ""
"The nonsettleable particle concentration after :math:`N_{Clearing}` clearing"
" events is given by"
msgstr ""
"La concentración de partículas no asentables tras :math:`N_{Clearing}` "
"eventos de limpieza está dada por"

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:57
msgid ""
"C_{P} = C_{P_0} \\left( 1 - "
"\\frac{{\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Suspension}}} "
"\\right)^{\\frac{{\\forall_{\\rm{Suspension}}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Surround}}}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:62
msgid ""
"The exponent, "
":math:`\\frac{{\\forall_{\\rm{Suspension}}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Surround}}}`, "
"can be multiplied by 1 in the form of "
":math:`\\frac{{\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}}` to "
"obtain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:64
msgid ""
"C_{P} = C_{P_0} \\left( 1 - "
"\\frac{{\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Suspension}}} "
"\\right)^{{\\frac{{\\forall_{\\rm{Suspension}}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}}}\\frac{{\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Surround}}}}"
msgstr ""

