msgid ""
"For large n the term :math:`\\left( 1-\\frac{1}{n}\\right)^n` approaches "
":math:`\\frac{1}{e}`. To meet this requirement we simply need the suspension"
" volume to be large compared with the volume cleared by a single floc. "
"Equation :eq:`sed_Cp_all_clearing_events_2` simplifies to"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:71
msgid ""
"\\frac{C_{TS_{flocFiltered}}}{C_{TS_{flocculated}}} = \\frac{C_{P}}{C_{P_0}}"
" =  \\left( \\frac{1}{e} "
"\\right)^\\frac{\\forall_{\\rm{Cleared}}}{\\forall_{\\rm{Surround}}}"
