#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:193
msgid ""
"The target flocculator Gt of 39,000 is crazy close to the current design. "
"This value will undoubtedly change somewhat as we get better measurements "
"for the floc filter rate constant."
msgstr ""
"El floculador objetivo Gt de 39.000 está increíblemente cerca del diseño "
