#: ../../Clarification/Clarifier_Theory_and_Future_Work.rst:195
msgid ""
"This analysis suggests that the primary particle concentration after "
"flocculation can be quite high when operating with a floc filter. Further "
"work will be required to ensure that startup is not a problem."
msgstr ""
"Este análisis sugiere que la concentración primaria de partículas tras la "
"floculación puede ser bastante alta cuando se opera con un filtro de "
